(7332649, 1144231, 30214, '<td valign="top">like a POV with these diverging lines, but it lacks a subject matter a bit. would love to see some people walking along those lines</td>', 'like a POV with these diverging lines, but it lacks a subject matter a bit. would love to see some people walking along those lines', '2015-03-23 00:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332672, 1144232, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well framed, with the tree beyond.  (I''m not sure if that''s a correct use of the word "plight" but that''s neither here nor there as far as the photograph is concerned.)  Lovely light, great tones.  Good detail where you need it.</td>', 'Very well framed, with the tree beyond.  (I''m not sure if that''s a correct use of the word "plight" but that''s neither here nor there as far as the photograph is concerned.)  Lovely light, great tones.  Good detail where you need it.', '2015-03-23 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332673, 1144711, 30982, '<td valign="top">He does seem a wee bit lost or confused.</td>', 'He does seem a wee bit lost or confused.', '2015-03-23 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332675, 1144638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Is her name really Susie?  Did you talk to her?  Good B&amp;W.  Sometimes I think we take advantage of the homeless for "street photography" but they are a major element of the streets.  I like the inclusion of the gent in the background.</td>', 'Is her name really Susie?  Did you talk to her?  Good B&W.  Sometimes I think we take advantage of the homeless for "street photography" but they are a major element of the streets.  I like the inclusion of the gent in the background.', '2015-03-23 00:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332676, 1144669, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sprite in front is almost lighter than air!  Such a lovely young lady.  The woman behind keeping a watchful eye....</td>', 'The sprite in front is almost lighter than air!  Such a lovely young lady.  The woman behind keeping a watchful eye....', '2015-03-23 00:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332678, 1144721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great candid - she looks as though she''s just a bit impatient, waiting for someone to ocme by and pick her up.  Interestingly, I can "see" the burst of color here, despite it being in B&amp;W, with all the flowers!</td>', 'Great candid - she looks as though she''s just a bit impatient, waiting for someone to ocme by and pick her up.  Interestingly, I can "see" the burst of color here, despite it being in B&W, with all the flowers!', '2015-03-23 00:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332679, 1144744, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I can''t imagine he''s a hit with young children, or unsuspecting adults for that matter!  Good catch.</td>', 'Yikes!  I can''t imagine he''s a hit with young children, or unsuspecting adults for that matter!  Good catch.', '2015-03-23 00:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332681, 1144699, 30982, '<td valign="top">You don''t see that much out here - the few that do still smoke tend to use those electronic cigarettes.  Focus seems to be a bit beyond your subject - the word "Fifth" draws my eye.</td>', 'You don''t see that much out here - the few that do still smoke tend to use those electronic cigarettes.  Focus seems to be a bit beyond your subject - the word "Fifth" draws my eye.', '2015-03-23 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332682, 1144681, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s some serious intensity there!  Not a soul seems to have noticed you.</td>', 'There''s some serious intensity there!  Not a soul seems to have noticed you.', '2015-03-23 00:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332683, 1144203, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like a live-action thought bubble.</td>', 'Like a live-action thought bubble.', '2015-03-23 00:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332684, 1144434, 30982, '<td valign="top">Skin cancer clinic dental?  what an odd combination.  Nice juxtaposition.  The "older" couple still have great physiques, too.</td>', 'Skin cancer clinic dental?  what an odd combination.  Nice juxtaposition.  The "older" couple still have great physiques, too.', '2015-03-23 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332685, 1144708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those lines in the middle of the road can be very threatening, it seems.  Love the light on the dog.</td>', 'Those lines in the middle of the road can be very threatening, it seems.  Love the light on the dog.', '2015-03-23 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332686, 1144402, 30982, '<td valign="top">I swear I saw a chicken at first.</td>', 'I swear I saw a chicken at first.', '2015-03-23 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332687, 1144650, 30982, '<td valign="top">More of a lane than a street, but an oddly sad and compelling shot.</td>', 'More of a lane than a street, but an oddly sad and compelling shot.', '2015-03-23 01:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332688, 1144677, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, excellent light.  Jagar-esque!</td>', 'Wonderful composition, excellent light.  Jagar-esque!', '2015-03-23 01:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332689, 1144729, 30982, '<td valign="top">What could have been/ships in the night.  Excellent street photography.</td>', 'What could have been/ships in the night.  Excellent street photography.', '2015-03-23 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332690, 1144712, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting display!</td>', 'Interesting display!', '2015-03-23 01:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332691, 1144745, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very initimate moment - we probably shouldn''t be here.  Great light, tones.</td>', 'A very initimate moment - we probably shouldn''t be here.  Great light, tones.', '2015-03-23 01:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332692, 1144458, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the guy way back there in the corner, keeping an eye on things.  I''ve never tried to sleep in one of these things - afraid I''d roll over and fall out!</td>', 'Like the guy way back there in the corner, keeping an eye on things.  I''ve never tried to sleep in one of these things - afraid I''d roll over and fall out!', '2015-03-23 01:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332693, 1144368, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen - wonderful light and tones on our foreground gent - your usual cell-phone staring guys beyond are off in their own electronic world.</td>', 'Well seen - wonderful light and tones on our foreground gent - your usual cell-phone staring guys beyond are off in their own electronic world.', '2015-03-23 01:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332694, 1144714, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Nice timing.</td>', 'Ha!  Nice timing.', '2015-03-23 01:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332695, 1144676, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fine use of slow shutter.</td>', 'Fine use of slow shutter.', '2015-03-23 01:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332696, 1144423, 30982, '<td valign="top">They both look quite content with each other''s company.</td>', 'They both look quite content with each other''s company.', '2015-03-23 01:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332697, 1144738, 30982, '<td valign="top">Poor little lass - missing an adult and a shoe.  Hopefully she found both.</td>', 'Poor little lass - missing an adult and a shoe.  Hopefully she found both.', '2015-03-23 01:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332698, 1144685, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome light!</td>', 'Awesome light!', '2015-03-23 01:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332706, 1144711, 56502, '<td valign="top">He sure looks desoriented! Maybe you should have told him: The Pasing Arkaden are to your left :-) - at least I think they are (If it''s not in Pasing, then it''s at least very similar). Anyway, I like his look out of the picture and the way the tunnel draws one into the picture.</td>', 'He sure looks desoriented! Maybe you should have told him: The Pasing Arkaden are to your left :-) - at least I think they are (If it''s not in Pasing, then it''s at least very similar). Anyway, I like his look out of the picture and the way the tunnel draws one into the picture.', '2015-03-23 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332773, 1144681, 141542, '<td valign="top">Truly, an excellent street shot.  What gives it away as a winner is that fact that many of us recognize this scene, but probably rarely see it, particularly outside of fiction (film).  What''s beautiful is that we have so many players in a two man game.  There''s obviously the two competitors, at it so intensely they have probably forgotten the crowd behind them.  Then there is this classic, smug character sitting right next to them, and his buddy not far off, looking on with far more humility and curiosity.  It''s all so evident right there in the faces of your subjects.  Beyond that, we have a crowd, interacting on its own levels, even in the shadows, conversation grows.<br/> <br/>Absolutely wonderful photography, although, I gave you a 9 and not a 10, reason being that the technical aspects could be a tad better.  So close to perfect, and the winner for this competition in my opinion.  Just classic.</td>', 'Truly, an excellent street shot.  What gives it away as a winner is that fact that many of us recognize this scene, but probably rarely see it, particularly outside of fiction (film).  What''s beautiful is that we have so many players in a two man game.  There''s obviously the two competitors, at it so intensely they have probably forgotten the crowd behind them.  Then there is this classic, smug character sitting right next to them, and his buddy not far off, looking on with far more humility and curiosity.  It''s all so evident right there in the faces of your subjects.  Beyond that, we have a crowd, interacting on its own levels, even in the shadows, conversation grows. Absolutely wonderful photography, although, I gave you a 9 and not a 10, reason being that the technical aspects could be a tad better.  So close to perfect, and the winner for this competition in my opinion.  Just classic.', '2015-03-23 08:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332774, 1144635, 141542, '<td valign="top">What an expression on that dog''s face!  Way to be there in the moment, and props to you for being courageous on a few levels.  Firstly, that courage to go out and take street shots which is the foundation of it all, but moreso the courage required for this far more intimate frame which the picture would be completely worthless without.  <br/> <br/>Things that would''ve brought your score up from my perspective: the luck to have the girl making true eye contact with our canine friend, and...you know actually on second look, that''s it.  So I''m upping the score now, hahaha.  You''re my second favorite this challenge.  I haven''t been to DPC in years, and I''m happy to be back.  Shots like this remind me of why I am.</td>', 'What an expression on that dog''s face!  Way to be there in the moment, and props to you for being courageous on a few levels.  Firstly, that courage to go out and take street shots which is the foundation of it all, but moreso the courage required for this far more intimate frame which the picture would be completely worthless without.   Things that would''ve brought your score up from my perspective: the luck to have the girl making true eye contact with our canine friend, and...you know actually on second look, that''s it.  So I''m upping the score now, hahaha.  You''re my second favorite this challenge.  I haven''t been to DPC in years, and I''m happy to be back.  Shots like this remind me of why I am.', '2015-03-23 08:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332775, 1144725, 141542, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots to use windows/reflections really well in this challenge.  It''s primarily this reflected buggy which really sets the image off as it gives you a cohesive theme.  The shadow of another rider shortly ahead of this one is also helpful.  Great shot, and thanks for taking it.</td>', 'One of the few shots to use windows/reflections really well in this challenge.  It''s primarily this reflected buggy which really sets the image off as it gives you a cohesive theme.  The shadow of another rider shortly ahead of this one is also helpful.  Great shot, and thanks for taking it.', '2015-03-23 08:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332776, 1144497, 141542, '<td valign="top">I love this implied relationship you''ve created, the framing and composition is pretty solid.  You lose a bit of the overall quality of the image with the wide angle distortion, sadly.  Regardless, a wonderful image.</td>', 'I love this implied relationship you''ve created, the framing and composition is pretty solid.  You lose a bit of the overall quality of the image with the wide angle distortion, sadly.  Regardless, a wonderful image.', '2015-03-23 08:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7332777, 1144738, 141542, '<td valign="top">Great isolation of the subject.  I rated this image highly mostly for that part, and it''s also technically good.  My biggest qualm is the foot going into the girl''s head, and this takes this from a top notch image to an almost-top notch image.  Well shot, and thanks for taking it.</td>', 'Great isolation of the subject.  I rated this image highly mostly for that part, and it''s also technically good.  My biggest qualm is the foot going into the girl''s head, and this takes this from a top notch image to an almost-top notch image.  Well shot, and thanks for taking it.', '2015-03-23 08:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
