(7334716, 1144650, 177322, '<td valign="top">When I saw those numbers on the mailbox, I reared back and adjusted my glasses!  My road is very similar to this and just add a zero to make the numbers on mailbox.  <i>&gt;&gt;play Twighlight Zone music here&lt;&lt;</i> <br/> <br/>Seems like we rural folks are at a disadvantage when it comes to ''street photography'' but each of us gave it a go.  Valiant effort.</td>', 'When I saw those numbers on the mailbox, I reared back and adjusted my glasses!  My road is very similar to this and just add a zero to make the numbers on mailbox.  >>play Twighlight Zone music here<<  Seems like we rural folks are at a disadvantage when it comes to ''street photography'' but each of us gave it a go.  Valiant effort.', '2015-03-27 00:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7334721, 1144480, 114285, '<td valign="top"><i><b>These two gentlemen were engaged in an apparently enjoyable conversation. Never once did I see either one of them check a phone or direct their attention elsewhere. That kind of thing just doesn''t happen as often as it should anymore.<br/></b></i>  Too true! <br/> <br/>A very good find!</td>', 'These two gentlemen were engaged in an apparently enjoyable conversation. Never once did I see either one of them check a phone or direct their attention elsewhere. That kind of thing just doesn''t happen as often as it should anymore.  Too true!  A very good find!', '2015-03-27 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
