(7334744, 1144669, 30214, '<td valign="top">Hey Romil, I appreciated your frank comment regardless :). Actually, this is more-less how I always process my shots now (i.e. very little). Just on that overcast day the light was rather flat, no shadows to speak of. Oh well. But I still like it as it is, I think it channels the atmosphere of the place, cold (in winter) and not very hospitable. Real de Catorce is actually a "ghost" town, with relatively few inhabitants.</td>', 'Hey Romil, I appreciated your frank comment regardless :). Actually, this is more-less how I always process my shots now (i.e. very little). Just on that overcast day the light was rather flat, no shadows to speak of. Oh well. But I still like it as it is, I think it channels the atmosphere of the place, cold (in winter) and not very hospitable. Real de Catorce is actually a "ghost" town, with relatively few inhabitants.', '2015-03-27 01:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
