(7335016, 1144661, 30049, '<td valign="top">I found this shot more interesting than some of the ones that finished ahead of yours.<br/> <br/>Side note regarding your personal comments ... if you want to step outside your "comfy zone", that''s all fine and good, however - don''t feel like you''re any less of a "photographer" if this genre isn''t something that regularly shows up in your portfolio.  It (Street Photography) is certainly not for everyone, nor does it have to be.<br/> <br/>Okay ... I''ve talked enough.  LOL  As you say, on to the next challenge.</td>', 'I found this shot more interesting than some of the ones that finished ahead of yours. Side note regarding your personal comments ... if you want to step outside your "comfy zone", that''s all fine and good, however - don''t feel like you''re any less of a "photographer" if this genre isn''t something that regularly shows up in your portfolio.  It (Street Photography) is certainly not for everyone, nor does it have to be. Okay ... I''ve talked enough.  LOL  As you say, on to the next challenge.', '2015-03-27 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
