(7335118, 1144316, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mitalapo:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> If this were sharply in focus, it would be an 11 from me.  SUCH a fabulous capture!   7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I don''t get it. How is sharpness worth 4 points? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t give any image higher than an 8 in this challenge.<br/> <br/>I was sorta being silly with the comment... to make a point.   Obviously, I can not give an 11.  <br/> <br/>I meant to emphasize that the image needs to be sharper FOR MY TASTE and to compliment the capture at the same time.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by mitalapo: Originally posted by Lydia: If this were sharply in focus, it would be an 11 from me.  SUCH a fabulous capture!   7  I don''t get it. How is sharpness worth 4 points?   I didn''t give any image higher than an 8 in this challenge. I was sorta being silly with the comment... to make a point.   Obviously, I can not give an 11.   I meant to emphasize that the image needs to be sharper FOR MY TASTE and to compliment the capture at the same time. ', '2015-03-28 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
